---
import Arrow from "./Arrow.astro";
---

<section
  class="community-overview"
  id="community"
  aria-labelledby="community-heading"
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="overview-intro">
      <div class="overview-heading">
        <h2 id="community-heading">
          You don’t have to<br />figure it out <em>alone.</em>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="overview-copy">
        <p class="overview-lead">
          The best next step is often a conversation with someone who gets it.
        </p>
        <p class="overview-description">
          We’re a community of people in Bangladesh building with HighLevel. We
          come together to exchange ideas, share practical knowledge, and turn
          online connections into real conversations.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="overview-benefits" id="benefits">
      <article class="overview-benefit">
        <span class="overview-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg
            width="26"
            height="26"
            viewBox="0 0 28 28"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.4"
            stroke-linecap="round"
          >
            <path d="M14 3v22M3 14h22M6.2 6.2l15.6 15.6M6.2 21.8L21.8 6.2"
            ></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="overview-eyebrow benefit-eyebrow">01 / Learn</span>
        <h3>Less guesswork.<br />More know-how.</h3>
        <p>
          Explore real use cases, ask the questions on your mind, and learn from
          people working with the same tools.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="overview-benefit">
        <span class="overview-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg
            width="28"
            height="28"
            viewBox="0 0 28 28"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.3"
          >
            <circle cx="14" cy="14" r="10"></circle>
            <circle cx="14" cy="14" r="5"></circle>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="overview-eyebrow benefit-eyebrow">02 / Connect</span>
        <h3>Meet peers.<br />Find your people.</h3>
        <p>
          Swap stories with local agency owners, marketers, and builders. Make
          connections that go beyond a comment thread.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="overview-benefit">
        <span class="overview-icon overview-arrow-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <Arrow />
        </span>
        <span class="overview-eyebrow benefit-eyebrow">03 / Grow</span>
        <h3>New perspectives.<br />Bigger possibilities.</h3>
        <p>
          Build confidence, sharpen your skills, and find fresh approaches to
          the challenges in your business.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .community-overview {
    padding-block: 92px 100px;
    background: #f6f8f1;
    color: #193f33;
    font-family: "Chapter Reference", "DM Sans", sans-serif;
  }
  .overview-intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
    gap: 100px;
  }
  .overview-eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font:
      600 10px/1.5 "DM Sans",
      sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .overview-heading h2 {
    font-size: clamp(40px, 4.3vw, 64px);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
  }
  .overview-heading h2 em {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.04em;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: italic;
    letter-spacing: -0.065em;
  }
  .overview-lead {
    max-width: 450px;
    color: #193f33;
    font-size: 23px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }
  .overview-description {
    max-width: 470px;
    margin-top: 20px;
    color: #778476;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .overview-benefits {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 38px;
    margin-top: 66px;
  }
  .overview-benefit {
    border-top: 1px solid #c4cfbb;
    padding-top: 27px;
  }
  .overview-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #e8eedf;
    color: #31563e;
    margin-bottom: 26px;
  }
  .overview-arrow-icon :global(.arrow-icon) {
    width: 27px;
    height: 27px;
    stroke-width: 1.2;
  }
  .benefit-eyebrow {
    color: #7a8774;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .overview-benefit h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(27px, 2.5vw, 35px);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }
  .overview-benefit p {
    max-width: 335px;
    margin-top: 20px;
    color: #778476;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .overview-intro {
      gap: 55px;
    }
    .overview-lead {
      font-size: 22px;
    }
    .overview-benefits {
      gap: 26px;
    }
    .overview-description {
      font-size: 15px;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .community-overview {
      padding-block: 60px;
    }
    .overview-intro {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 26px;
    }
    .overview-eyebrow {
      font-size: 9px;
    }
    .overview-heading h2 {
      font-size: clamp(36px, 9.2vw, 48px);
    }
    .overview-lead {
      max-width: 100%;
      font-size: 23px;
    }
    .overview-description {
      max-width: 100%;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .overview-benefits {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 31px;
      margin-top: 45px;
    }
    .overview-benefit {
      padding-top: 24px;
    }
    .overview-icon {
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }
    .overview-benefit h3 {
      font-size: 31px;
    }
    .overview-benefit p {
      max-width: 100%;
      margin-top: 17px;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
  }
</style>
